abstract: >
  SZL Holdings — Doctrine v11 (749 declarations / 14 axioms / 163 sorries, kernel
  c7c0ba17). Locked-proven = exactly 8 {F1,F4,F7,F11,F12,F18,F19,F22}. Λ unconditional
  uniqueness = Conjecture 1 (machine-checked FALSE); conditional Theorem U is axiom-free.
  Khipu BFT safety = Conjecture 2 (Wave23 conditional agreement lemma proven). Thesis v6
  unifies methodological lineages — Sherman Morgan constrained propulsion optimization,
  Stewart collision/EOS/angular-momentum diagnostics, Lindblad/GKS/Baumgratz-Cramer-Plenio
  open-quantum coherence, and Byzantine quorum safety — with full attribution to original
  authors. NEW Wave24 result: coherence monotone strict-decay under Lindblad dephasing
  (PROPOSED; becomes EXPERIMENTAL only on green lake build, lutar-lean PR #225; never joins
  the locked 8). SLSA L1+L2 attested, L3 roadmap. Trust never 100%.
